<EditorialShell title="Productivity Caller | Kotlin Reminder App" description="See how Shivam Mahajan built Productivity Caller with Kotlin and Jetpack Compose, using phone calls for reminders." eyebrow="Move 001 / Kotlin" heading="Productivity Caller" intro="A Kotlin and Jetpack Compose reminder app that uses phone calls. This page covers its reminder flow, parser, and current evidence.">
